     2377         sort-prd  I-sort-prd    v-sort-prd
     2378         torg2-no   I-torg2-no v-torg2-no
     2379         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2380       ENABLE B-exit  B-quit  B-Help FILL-IN-4 RECT-2
     2381         invprn0  I-invprn0  v-invprn0
     2382         outprncd I-outprncd v-outprncd
