     2450         outogr    B-13  I-outogr  v-outogr
     2451         outC    B-27  I-outc    v-outc
     2452         FILL-IN-1
     2453         outdisc   B-3 I-outdisc   B-outdisc v-outdisc
     2454         outegrp   B-4 I-outegrp B-outegrp v-outegrp
