     2494         outasend  B-23  I-outasend  B-outasend  v-outasend
     2495         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2496       ENABLE B-exit  B-quit  B-Help FILL-IN-4 RECT-2
     2497         fgdsnind  B-20  I-fgdsnind  v-fgdsnind
     2498         outssdoc  B-1 I-outssdoc  v-outssdoc
     2499         in-docpr  B-2 I-in-docpr  v-in-docpr
