     2662   IF thbjattr_thbj-attr-o.prop-code = 'outasend':U THEN DO:     outasend = thbjattr_thbj-attr-o.property-value-character.     outasend:private-data in frame Dialog-Frame = "recid2=" + string(recid(thbjattr_thbj-attr-o)).     display outasend with frame Dialog-Frame . END.
